etm-powersync-car (0.1.8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: AC phase count of the vehicle as a thing
    setting (acPhaseCount, 1 to 3, default 3), published as the states
    phaseCount (read by the energy manager) and acPhaseCount, at setup and
    on each change; it survives a reconfiguration through the pairing
    dialog like the other settings. The API does not give it.

