etm-powersync-car (0.1.7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: the settings (reading interval, battery
    capacity) survive a reconfiguration through the pairing dialog again;
    the defaults nymea puts back during the setup are no longer stored
    over the values kept by the plugin.

