etm-powersync-car (0.1.6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: battery capacity setting 0-200 kWh without a
    gap, checked by nymea alone (0 = unknown); the plugin no longer refuses
    small values nor puts a value back.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:42:37 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: the battery capacity becomes a thing setting
    (0 = unknown, else 10-200 kWh), changed at once without a request; its
    value is taken over from the former param on the first start. The
    settings survive a reconfiguration through the pairing dialog. A failed
    reading is still retried while unplugged (documented).

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:27:01 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: no periodic reading while the vehicle is
    unplugged. The reading interval while plugged in (5-120 min, default
    30) becomes a thing setting, changed at once without a request. New
    action "Relire maintenant" (refresh). The pairing validation answer is
    the first reading: a pairing costs 1 request.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:16:18 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: reads every 30 min when plugged in or when the
    plug state is unknown, every 60 min when unplugged (thing params,
    5-120 and 15-240 min). Never less than 5 min between two requests,
    across restarts and reconfigurations too.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:45:52 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: publishes the state of charge, the plug state
    and the API status only. The states targetSoc, targetSocSource,
    batteryCareMode, rangeKm, plugLockState, vehicleChargingState and
    vehicleChargingStateRaw are removed, and the matching API fields are no
    longer read. Charge limits are a setting of the energy manager.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:23:16 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: targetSoc is now the effective charge target:
    the battery care target while the battery care mode is activated, the
    charge limit otherwise. New states targetSocSource and batteryCareMode.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:08:51 +0100

etm-powersync-car (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * powersync-plugin-skoda: first version. Reads the charging part of the
    MyŠkoda public API (contract 1.1.0): state of charge with its timestamp
    and source, plug and lock state, charging state, charge limit, range,
    API key expiry and quota. Read-only, one domain, HTTPS only. Built
    against nymea 1.15.2.

 -- ETM-Schurig SARL <contact@etm-schurig.eu>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:53:51 +0100
